# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Memory System

## Purpose
Document what long-lived context the agents should preserve across tasks.

## Memory Layers
- `core.md` — stable project context and conventions
- `recent.md` — last approved task summaries
- `patterns.md` — recurring issues and successful fixes
- `decisions.md` — durable architectural decisions

## Usage
- Keep `core.md` concise and stable
- Let automation append to `recent.md`
- Record repeated failures in `patterns.md`
- Record important tradeoffs in `decisions.md`
